{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香港電腦通訊節明日起，一連四日於灣仔會展舉行。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今屆有逾200間參展商，設逾600個展位，部分展商已準備好折扣優惠吸客，但亦有展商指，基於全球晶片及記憶體供不應求，今年不同級別的電腦，都較往年貴約3成，優惠幅度亦縮減，又預料電腦價格只會越來越貴。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.COMPUTER-1630_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026Mz92cuh0il1787219651.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.COMPUTER-1630_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">電腦通訊節成人票價35元，小童及長者等免費入場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T10:19:11.475356+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}